# The Server image (Dockerfile) builds from these paths only. Everything else stays out of the build context: config
# and its local overlay, data, tokens, virtual environments, test output and the git history.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!scripts/packaging/agent_harness_build.py
!harness/
!harness_modules/
!sdk/harness_client.py
!macrunner/harness_runner.py
!macrunner/sandbox.sb
!macrunner/dev.agent-harness.runner.plist
!macrunner/install.sh
!docs/marketplace-manifest.schema.json
!docs/hub.entries.example.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.*
